.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></li><li><a class="_14ad61j0 _1rcd22id" href="https://you.com/resources">Blog</a></li><li class="_1ngqacoe"><a class="ikqnhj0 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvae _1rcd22ia _1fqvkvai _1fqvkvap" data-size="xs" data-color="default" data-variant="solid" href="https://you.com/book-demo">Contact Sales<span class="_4vfo6n3 _1rcd22i1c _4vfo6n0 o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut5k o71fut2h0 o71fut2g9 o71fut288 o71fut2ka o71fut6w o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2i7 o71fut2gk _4vfo6n4 _4vfo6n1 o71fut2h1 o71fut2fw o71fut2hm" data-color="default">C</span></a></li><li class="_1ngqacof"><button type="button" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-base-ui-navigation-menu-trigger="" data-size="xs" data-color="contrast" data-variant="solid" class="_1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvab _1fqvkvae _1rcd22ia _1fqvkvai _1fqvkvap">Sign in<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down _2lwuww0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></li></ul></nav><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-haspopup="true" data-state="closed" aria-expanded="false" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="_112t1nv0 o71fut8 o71fut3 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva8 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvam"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu _2lwuww0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="qzynqc1"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://you.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Pricing","item":"https://you.com/pricing"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What counts as a billable call?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One request to an endpoint is one billable call, whatever it returns. A Web Search call returning 1 result and one returning 100 cost the same. Contents is billed per page returned."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need a credit card to start?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. You get $100 in API credit when you sign up, no credit card required. You only need to add a payment method when you're ready to upgrade to a paid plan or your free credits run out."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do credits expire?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free signup credits are valid for 60 days. Credits purchased on a paid plan do not expire as long as your account is active."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens if I run out of credits mid-run?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you run out of credits, your API calls will return a 402 Payment Required response. You can add credits at any time from your dashboard to resume immediately. Enterprise plans can set up auto-recharge to avoid interruptions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there rate limits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Free tier includes 100 queries per day with a default rate limit. Paid plans offer higher QPS limits, and enterprise plans support custom QPS limits tailored to your workload."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do the Research effort tiers differ, and which should I use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lite handles simple factual lookups in a single pass. Standard balances depth and speed for most production research. Deep cross-references several sources for complex questions. Exhaustive verifies claims across dozens of sources for high-stakes work. Frontier is for research too long to finish inside a request and runs in background mode only. Start with Lite and scale up as your use case demands more depth."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the MCP server billed separately?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The MCP server uses the same API keys and credits as the REST API. Calls made through the MCP server are billed at the same rate as direct API calls."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer volume or annual discounts?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. For usage above 1M calls per month, contact sales for custom pricing. Enterprise plans include negotiated rates, custom QPS limits, and dedicated support."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I get a DPA? Is there zero data retention?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Zero Data Retention (ZDR) is available on enterprise plans. All queries and responses are automatically purged and never stored. Contact sales to enable ZDR for your account."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there anything for startups?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer extended free credits for eligible early-stage startups. Contact sales with your company details to apply."}}]}]</script><section class="_1c9zbzm1 _1c9zbzm0 o71fut1ds o71fut1e2 o71fut1ec o71fut1mo o71fut1n6 o71fut1ng o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut7s o71fut2j9" aria-labelledby="pricing-hero-headline"><div class="_1c9zbzm2 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut7s o71futaw o71fut2ew"><div class="_1c9zbzm4 _1c9zbzm3 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut7s o71fut9k"><h1 class="_1c9zbzm6 _1gg5qfz1 _1c9zbzm5 o71fut2h1" id="pricing-hero-headline">Web Search APIs, priced per call</h1><p class="_1c9zbzm8 _1gg5qfz6 _1c9zbzm7 o71fut2h2">Choose the level of intelligence your workload needs.</p></div><div class="_1c9zbzma _1c9zbzm9 o71fut8 o71fut9k o71fut7s o71fut5k"><a href="#pricing-cards" class="_1c9zbzmc _1gg5qfzg _1c9zbzmb o71fut1yo o71fut26g o71fut1iw o71fut1qo o71fut2h2 o71fut2hj o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2j2 o71fut2jk">How to buy</a><a href="#pricing-apis" class="_1c9zbzmc _1gg5qfzg _1c9zbzmb o71fut1yo o71fut26g o71fut1iw o71fut1qo o71fut2h2 o71fut2hj o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2j2 o71fut2jk">What to buy</a><a href="#pricing-decide" class="_1c9zbzmc _1gg5qfzg _1c9zbzmb o71fut1yo o71fut26g o71fut1iw o71fut1qo o71fut2h2 o71fut2hj o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2j2 o71fut2jk">Use cases</a><a href="#pricing-enterprise" class="_1c9zbzmc _1gg5qfzg _1c9zbzmb o71fut1yo o71fut26g o71fut1iw o71fut1qo o71fut2h2 o71fut2hj o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2j2 o71fut2jk">For Enterprise</a><a href="#pricing-faq" class="_1c9zbzmc _1gg5qfzg _1c9zbzmb o71fut1yo o71fut26g o71fut1iw o71fut1qo o71fut2h2 o71fut2hj o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2j2 o71fut2jk">FAQs</a></div></div></section><section id="pricing-cards" class="cewj9j1 cewj9j0 o71fut1mo o71fut1n6 o71fut1ng" aria-labelledby="pricing-cards-headline"><div class="cewj9j2"><div class="cewj9j4 cewj9j3 o71fut1c o71futa0 o71futa4 o71fut2ew"><div class="_17jvz0p1 _17jvz0p0 o71fut1d4 o71fut1kw o71fut1so o71fut20g o71fut8 o71fut28 o71futa0 o71fut2ew o71fut40 o71fut2ia o71fut2fe o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2hk o71fut2w"><svg class="_17jvz0p3 _17jvz0p2 o71fut34" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" width="285.333" height="274.582" viewBox="0 0 285.333 274.582" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="donut" clip-path="url(#clip0_0_30)"><path id="Vector" d="M273.657 83.4582C270.362 75.9299 266.306 68.4088 261.432 60.9304C255.604 52.9111 249.343 45.7458 242.69 39.413C242.661 39.3703 242.619 39.3276 242.554 39.2778C236.129 33.1584 229.377 27.8146 222.382 23.2038C198.95 7.7844 172.715 0.597705 146.715 0.362892C137.842 0.263275 128.983 0.98906 120.288 2.48332C111.664 3.93489 103.19 6.1407