><a href="#api-research-api" class="jqn31e6 _1gg5qfzf jqn31e5 o71fut2h2 o71fut2jk">Research API</a><a href="#api-finance-research-api" class="jqn31e6 _1gg5qfzf jqn31e5 o71fut2h2 o71fut2jk">Finance Research API</a></div></nav><div class="_1up9hfzc _1up9hfzb o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut6o"><div class="_1up9hfzd o71fut8 o71fut28 o71futbc"><div class="_1up9hfze o71fut1s8 o71fut1ro o71fut200 o71fut1zg o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k"><h3 class="_1up9hfzg _1gg5qfz3 _1up9hfzf o71fut2h1">Web Search</h3><p class="_1up9hfzi _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfzh o71fut2h2">You get the sources and do the reasoning.</p></div><div class="_1up9hfzk _1up9hfzj o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut2ew o71fut40 o71fut2i2 o71fut2hr o71fut2i3"><div class="_1up9hfzo _1up9hfzn o71fut0 o71futc o71fut2ew o71fut2fn"><div class="_1up9hfzq _1up9hfzp o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut2ew o71fut6s o71fut70"><p class="_1up9hfzu _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfzt o71fut2h9">Endpoint</p></div><div class="_1up9hfzs _1up9hfzr o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut2ew o71fut70"><p class="_1up9hfzu _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfzt o71fut2h9">Latency</p></div><div class="_1up9hfzs _1up9hfzr o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut2ew o71fut70"><p class="_1up9hfzu _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfzt o71fut2h9">Price</p></div></div><div class="_1up9hfzm _1up9hfzl o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut2ew" id="api-web-search-api"><div class="_1up9hfzw _1up9hfzv o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g"><div class="_1up9hfzy _1up9hfzx o71fut1s8 o71fut1sk o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut6s o71fut70"><div class="_1up9hfzz o71fut8 o71fut9k o71fut7s"><a href="https://you.com/docs/guides/search" class="_1up9hfz11 _1up9hfz10 o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut9k o71fut2h1" aria-label="Web Search API documentation"><span class="_1up9hfz16 _1gg5qfz5 _1up9hfz15 o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Web Search API</span><span class="_1up9hfz12 o71fut8 o71fut5k o71fut7s o71fut2fm o71fut288 o71fut2ka o71fut2ir"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right _1up9hfz14 _1up9hfz13 o71fut280 o71fut2k9 o71fut2hh" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><div data-color="special" class="fsr9ij0">Free tier</div></div><p class="_1up9hfz18 _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz17 o71fut2h2">Real-time web and news results, optimized for programmatic access in AI applications.</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1n _1up9hfz1m o71fut8 o71fut2g o71fut2ew o71fut1s8"><div class="_1up9hfz1q _1up9hfz1p o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"></div><div class="_1up9hfz1s _1up9hfz1r o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"></div></div></div><div class="_1up9hfz1a _1up9hfz19 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g" id="api-web-search-free"><div class="_1up9hfz1c _1up9hfz1b o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71futgg o71fut7k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut1s8 o71fut1tg o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut6s o71fut70"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-corner-down-right _1up9hfz1d o71fut6w o71fut280 o71fut2k9 o71futh4 o71fut2h1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 10 5 5-5 5"></path><path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h12"></path></svg><div class="_1up9hfz1e o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k"><div class="_1up9hfz1f o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut9k"><span class="_1up9hfz1h _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1g o71fut2h3 o71fut2jk">Web Search API</span><span class="_1up9hfz1j _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1i o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Free</span></div><p class="_1up9hfz1l _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1k o71fut2h2">Live search through the MCP server, no API key—up to 100 queries a day. Prototype or drop live search into an agent before committing.</p></div></div><div class="_1up9hfz1o _1up9hfz1n _1up9hfz1m o71fut8 o71fut2g o71fut2ew o71fut1s8"><div class="_1up9hfz1q _1up9hfz1p o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Latency</p><p class="_1up9hfz1w _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1v o71fut2h2">p50 ~0.4s</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1s _1up9hfz1r o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Price</p><div class="_1up9hfz1y _1up9hfz1x o71fut8 o71futg0 o71fut2jk"><p class="_1up9hfz20 _1gg5qfz3 _1up9hfz1z o71fut2h1">Free</p></div></div></div></div><div class="_1up9hfz1a _1up9hfz19 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g" id="api-web-search-standard"><div class="_1up9hfz1c _1up9hfz1b o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71futgg o71fut7k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut1s8 o71fut1tg o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut6s o71fut70"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-corner-down-right _1up9hfz1d o71fut6w o71fut280 o71fut2k9 o71futh4 o71fut2h1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 10 5 5-5 5"></path><path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h12"></path></svg><div class="_1up9hfz1e o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k"><div class="_1up9hfz1f o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut9k"><span class="_1up9hfz1h _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1g o71fut2h3 o71fut2jk">Web Search API</span><span class="_1up9hfz1j _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1i o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Standard</span></div><p class="_1up9hfz1l _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1k o71fut2h2">Full endpoint access: Highlights, Knowledge, extraction, and domain filters. Built for production traffic at scale.</p></div></div><div class="_1up9hfz1o _1up9hfz1n _1up9hfz1m o71fut8 o71fut2g o71fut2ew o71fut1s8"><div class="_1up9hfz1q _1up9hfz1p o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Latency</p><p class="_1up9hfz1w _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1v o71fut2h2">p50 ~0.4s</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1s _1up9hfz1r o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Price</p><div class="_1up9hfz1y _1up9hfz1x o71fut8 o71futg0 o71fut2jk"><p class="_1up9hfz20 _1gg5qfz3 _1up9hfz1z o71fut2h1">$5</p><p class="_1up9hfz22 _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz21 o71fut2h2">/1k calls</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_1up9hfzw _1up9hfzv o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g" id="api-contents-api"><div class="_1up9hfzy _1up9hfzx o71fut1s8 o71fut1sk o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut6s o71fut70"><div class="_1up9hfzz o71fut8 o71fut9k o71fut7s"><a href="https://you.com/docs/guides/contents" class="_1up9hfz11 _1up9hfz10 o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut9k o71fut2h1" aria-label="Contents API documentation"><span class="_1up9hfz16 _1gg5qfz5 _1up9hfz15 o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Contents API</span><span class="_1up9hfz12 o71fut8 o71fut5k o71fut7s o71fut2fm o71fut288 o71fut2ka o71fut2ir"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right _1up9hfz14 _1up9hfz13 o71fut280 o71fut2k9 o71fut2hh" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><p class="_1up9hfz18 _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz17 o71fut2h2">Give it URLs you already have, get back clean Markdown or HTML per page. Use it when you know which pages you want and just need them parsed, not searched.</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1n _1up9hfz1m o71fut8 o71fut2g o71fut2ew o71fut1s8"><div class="_1up9hfz1q _1up9hfz1p o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Latency</p><p class="_1up9hfz1w _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1v o71fut2h2">1-10s per page</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1s _1up9hfz1r o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Price</p><div class="_1up9hfz1y _1up9hfz1x o71fut8 o71futg0 o71fut2jk"><p class="_1up9hfz20 _1gg5qfz3 _1up9hfz1z o71fut2h1">$1</p><p class="_1up9hfz22 _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz21 o71fut2h2">/1k Pages</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_1up9hfzd o71fut8 o71fut28 o71futbc"><div class="_1up9hfze o71fut1s8 o71fut1ro o71fut200 o71fut1zg o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k"><h3 class="_1up9hfzg _1gg5qfz3 _1up9hfzf o71fut2h1">Agentic Research</h3><p class="_1up9hfzi _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfzh o71fut2h2">We do the reasoning and hand back the answer.</p></div><div class="_1up9hfzk _1up9hfzj o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut2ew o71fut40 o71fut2i2 o71fut2hr o71fut2i3"><div class="_1up9hfzo _1up9hfzn o71fut0 o71futc o71fut2ew o71fut2fn"><div class="_1up9hfzq _1up9hfzp o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut2ew o71fut6s o71fut70"><p class="_1up9hfzu _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfzt o71fut2h9">Endpoint</p></div><div class="_1up9hfzs _1up9hfzr o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut2ew o71fut70"><p class="_1up9hfzu _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfzt o71fut2h9">Latency</p></div><div class="_1up9hfzs _1up9hfzr o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut2ew o71fut70"><p class="_1up9hfzu _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfzt o71fut2h9">Price</p></div></div><div class="_1up9hfzw _1up9hfzv o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g" id="api-answer-api"><div class="_1up9hfzy _1up9hfzx o71fut1s8 o71fut1sk o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut6s o71fut70"><div class="_1up9hfzz o71fut8 o71fut9k o71fut7s"><a href="https://you.com/docs/guides/answer" class="_1up9hfz11 _1up9hfz10 o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut9k o71fut2h1" aria-label="Answer API documentation"><span class="_1up9hfz16 _1gg5qfz5 _1up9hfz15 o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Answer API</span><span class="_1up9hfz12 o71fut8 o71fut5k o71fut7s o71fut2fm o71fut288 o71fut2ka o71fut2ir"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right _1up9hfz14 _1up9hfz13 o71fut280 o71fut2k9 o71fut2hh" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><p class="_1up9hfz18 _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz17 o71fut2h2">One call turns a question into a cited answer with the sources it used. Choose this over Web Search when you want the answer written for you, not a list of links to synthesize yourself.</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1n _1up9hfz1m o71fut8 o71fut2g o71fut2ew o71fut1s8"><div class="_1up9hfz1q _1up9hfz1p o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Latency</p><p class="_1up9hfz1w _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz1v o71fut2h2">p50 ~2.7s</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1s _1up9hfz1r o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"><p class="_1up9hfz1u _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz1t o71fut2h1 o71futg o71fut4">Price</p><div class="_1up9hfz1y _1up9hfz1x o71fut8 o71futg0 o71fut2jk"><p class="_1up9hfz20 _1gg5qfz3 _1up9hfz1z o71fut2h1">$5</p><p class="_1up9hfz22 _1gg5qfzh _1up9hfz21 o71fut2h2">/1k calls</p></div></div></div></div><div class="_1up9hfzm _1up9hfzl o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut2ew" id="api-research-api"><div class="_1up9hfzw _1up9hfzv o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g"><div class="_1up9hfzy _1up9hfzx o71fut1s8 o71fut1sk o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut6s o71fut70"><div class="_1up9hfzz o71fut8 o71fut9k o71fut7s"><a href="https://you.com/docs/guides/research" class="_1up9hfz11 _1up9hfz10 o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut9k o71fut2h1" aria-label="Research API documentation"><span class="_1up9hfz16 _1gg5qfz5 _1up9hfz15 o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Research API</span><span class="_1up9hfz12 o71fut8 o71fut5k o71fut7s o71fut2fm o71fut288 o71fut2ka o71fut2ir"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right _1up9hfz14 _1up9hfz13 o71fut280 o71fut2k9 o71fut2hh" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><p class="_1up9hfz18 _1gg5qfz7 _1up9hfz17 o71fut2h2">Multi-step research on the open web. It plans, searches repeatedly, reads full pages, and cross-references before answering. One research_effort parameter tunes cost and depth across five levels:</p></div><div class="_1up9hfz1n _1up9hfz1m o71fut8 o71fut2g o71fut2ew o71fut1s8"><div class="_1up9hfz1q _1up9hfz1p o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"></div><div class="_1up9hfz1s _1up9hfz1r o71fut1rk o71fut1sk o71fut1zc o71fut20c o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c o71fut2fe o71fut6o o71fut6k o71fut6w"></div></div></div><div class="_1up9hfz1a _1up9hfz19 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut24 o71fut2ew o71fut7g" id="api-research-lite"><div class="_1up9hfz1c _1up9hfz1b o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71futgg o71fut7k o71fut2ew o71fut2fe o71fut1s8 o71fut1tg o71fut200 o71fut20c o71fut6s o71fu