 o71fut2ew"><span class="_89at7lm _1gg5qfzc _89at7ll o71fut2h1 o71fut6o o71fut2j5 o71fut2l6">Produce a research report</span><span class="_89at7lp _89at7lo _89at7ln o71fut27k o71fut2k7 o71fut6w" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="_89at7li _89at7lh o71fut1s8 o71fut200 o71fut1cw o71fut1ko o71fut8 o71futgg o71fut7s o71fut5k o71fut2ew"><span class="_89at7lm _1gg5qfzc _89at7ll o71fut2h1 o71fut6o o71fut2j5 o71fut2l6">Analyze financial or market data</span><span class="_89at7lp _89at7lo _89at7ln o71fut27k o71fut2k7 o71fut6w" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></div><div class="_89at7lr _89at7lq o71fut1d4 o71fut1dw o71fut1kw o71fut1lo o71fut1so o71fut1tg o71fut20g o71fut218 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71futaw o71fut2ew o71fut40 o71fut2i9 o71fut2fe o71fut6r"><div class="_89at7ls o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9s"><div class="_89at7lt o71fut8 o71futg8 o71fut7s"><span class="_89at7lv _89at7lu o71fut27k o71fut2k7 o71fut6w" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="_89at7lx _1gg5qfzh _89at7lw o71fut2h1">Web Search</p></div><div class="_89at7lz _89at7ly o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut68 o71fut9k"><p class="_89at7l11 _1gg5qfz3 _89at7l10 o71fut2h1 o71fut2jk">Web Search API</p><div class="_89at7l13 _89at7l12 o71fut8 o71futg0 o71fut2jk"><p class="_89at7l15 _1gg5qfz3 _89at7l14 o71fut2h1">$5</p><p class="_89at7l17 _1gg5qfzh _89at7l16 o71fut2h2">/1k calls</p></div></div></div><hr class="_89at7l19 _89at7l18 o71fut2ew _186s4h0 _186s4h1"/><p class="_89at7l1b _1gg5qfz7 _89at7l1a o71fut2h2 o71fut6o">Ranked web and news results your model reads and reasons over. You keep full control of synthesis — ideal for RAG.</p><div class="_89at7l1c o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9s"><p class="_89at7l1e _1gg5qfzh _89at7l1d o71fut1sg o71fut208 o71fut1co o71fut1kg o71fut2h9 o71fut2ew o71fut2fn o71fut2i9">$100 free credit = 20,000 searches</p><div class="_89at7l1f o71fut8 o71fut9s o71fut7s"><a class="_89at7l1g o71fut6o ikqnhj0 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvab _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1f