mlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide mtkueoe o71fut2ew o71fut2l4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M28.6357 2.6709L49.5176 10.8145V10.8154L51.1504 11.4561L51.2441 13.209V13.2109C51.5321 18.1918 50.7565 25.8323 47.5303 33.3096C44.2779 40.8384 38.4907 48.2866 28.7285 52.5352L27.6494 53.0039L26.5713 52.5352C16.8091 48.2866 11.0219 40.8384 7.76953 33.3096C4.54362 25.8429 3.7678 18.1929 4.05566 13.2119L4.15723 11.457L5.79199 10.8154L5.79102 10.8145L26.6738 2.6709H26.6758L27.6504 2.28613L28.6357 2.6709Z" stroke="currentColor"></path><path d="M34.6328 21.3998L25.4662 30.5664L21.2995 26.3998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mtkueog _1gg5qfz6 mtkueof o71fut2h1 o71fut2gy">DPA-ready</h3><p class="mtkueoi _1gg5qfz8 mtkueoh o71fut2h2">Designed to seamlessly accommodate Data Processing Agreements.</p></li><li class="mtkueoc o71fut1ds o71fut1lk o71fut1tc o71fut214 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ic o71fut2fe o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2hr"><div class="mtkueod o71fut8 o71fut2a8 o71fut2kj o71fut2h9 o71futpk" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide mtkueoe o71fut2ew o71fut2l4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M28 4.16699C31.2266 4.16708 34.3209 5.44895 36.6025 7.73047C38.8842 10.0121 40.166 13.1072 40.166 16.334V25.167H44.333C47.1865 25.167 49.5 27.4805 49.5 30.334V46.667C49.4999 49.5203 47.1864 51.834 44.333 51.834H11.667C8.8136 51.834 6.50013 49.5203 6.5 46.667V30.334C6.5 27.4805 8.81352 25.167 11.667 25.167H15.833V16.334C15.833 13.1072 17.1149 10.0121 19.3965 7.73047C21.6782 5.44878 24.7732 4.16699 28 4.16699ZM11.667 26.167C9.36581 26.167 7.5 28.0328 7.5 30.334V46.667C7.50013 48.9681 9.36589 50.834 11.667 50.834H44.333C46.6341 50.834 48.4999 48.9681 48.5 46.667V30.334C48.5 28.0328 46.6342 26.167 44.333 26.167H11.667ZM28 5.16699C25.0384 5.16699 22.1977 6.34334 20.1035 8.4375C18.0094 10.5316 16.833 13.3725 16.833 16.334V25.167H39.166V16.334C39.166 13.3725 37.9896 10.5316 35.8955 8.4375C33.8014 6.34352 30.9614 5.16708 28 5.16699Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mtkueog _1gg5qfz6 mtkueof o71fut2h1 o71fut2gy">CCPA</h3><p class="mtkueoi _1gg5qfz8 mtkueoh o71fut2h2">Compliant with California Consumer Privacy Act requirements for data handling and consumer rights.</p></li><li class="mtkueoc o71fut1ds o71fut1lk o71fut1tc o71fut214 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ic o71fut2fe o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2hr"><div class="mtkueod o71fut8 o71fut2a8 o71fut2kj o71fut2h9 o71futpk" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide mtkueoe o71fut2ew o71fut2l4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30.3333 7V23.3333H44.3333L25.6667 49V32.6667H11.6667L30.3333 7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mtkueog _1gg5qfz6 mtkueof o71fut2h1 o71fut2gy">Custom QPS limits</h3><p class="mtkueoi _1gg5qfz8 mtkueoh o71fut2h2">Enterprise-grade concurrency with performance optimization for high-volume usage available on request.</p></li><li class="mtkueoc o71fut1ds o71fut1lk o71fut1tc o71fut214 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9k o71fut2ic o71fut2fe o71fut2i4 o71fut2i2 o71fut2hr"><div class="mtkueod o71fut8 o71fut2a8 o71fut2kj o71fut2h9 o71futpk" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide mtkueoe o71fut2ew o71fut2l4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 25.6667H14C15.2377 25.6667 16.4247 26.1583 17.2998 27.0335C18.175 27.9087 18.6667 29.0957 18.6667 30.3333V37.3333C18.6667 38.571 18.175 39.758 17.2998 40.6332C16.4247 41.5083 15.2377 42 14 42H11.6667C10.429 42 9.242 41.5083 8.36683 40.6332C7.49167 39.758 7 38.571 7 37.3333V25.6667ZM7 25.6667C7 22.9089 7.54318 20.1782 8.59853 17.6303C9.65388 15.0825 11.2007 12.7675 13.1508 10.8174C15.1008 8.86739 17.4158 7.32055 19.9636 6.2652C22.5115 5.20985 25.2422 4.66667 28 4.66667C30.7578 4.66667 33.4885 5.20985 36.0364 6.2652C38.5842 7.32055 40.8992 8.86739 42.8492 10.8174C44.7993 12.7675 46.3461 15.0825 47.4015 17.6303C48.4568 20.1782 49 22.9089 49 25.6667M49 25.6667V37.3333M49 25.6667H42C40.7623 25.6667 39.5753 26.1583 38.7002 27.0335C37.825 27.9087 37.3333 29.0957 37.3333 30.3333V37.3333C37.3333 38.571 37.825 39.758 38.7002 40.6332C39.5753 41.5083 40.7623 42 42 42H44.3333C45.571 42 46.758 41.5083 47.6332 40.6332C48.5083 39.758 49 38.571 49 37.3333M49 37.3333V42C49 44.4754 48.0167 46.8493 46.2663 48.5997C44.516 50.35 42.142 51.3333 39.6667 51.3333H28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mtkueog _1gg5qfz6 mtkueof o71fut2h1 o71fut2gy">Dedicated support</h3><p class="mtkueoi _1gg5qfz8 mtkueoh o71fut2h2">Direct access to our engineering team for onboarding, optimization, and priority issue resolution.</p></li><li class="mtkueok mtkueoj o71fut8 o71fut28"><figure class="_1nhcjnh0 o71fut1ds o71fut1lk o71fut1tc o71fut214 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut68 o71futaw o71fut2ic o71fut40 o71fut2fn"><blockquote class="_1nhcjnh2 _1gg5qfz4 _1nhcjnh1 o71fut2h1">The reliability and latency improvements when using You.com were decisive factors. We cut P50 web search latency from over five seconds to sub-one second and pushed our success rate to three 9s or higher.</blockquote><figcaption class="_1nhcjnh4 _1nhcjnh3 o71fut8 o71fut7s o71fut68 o71futa0 o71fut2ew"><div class="_1nhcjnh5 o71fut8 o71futa0 o71fut7s"><div class="_1nhcjnh6 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut9c"><p class="_1nhcjnh8 _1gg5qfz7 _1nhcjnh7 o71fut2h1">Jonat