.1335 12.7032 10.1217 12.7489 10.0955C12.7943 10.0693 12.8303 10.0299 12.8524 9.98316C14.1746 7.17294 15.9534 3.15364 15.6082 2.55055H15.6063Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></figcaption></figure></li></ul></div></section><section id="pricing-faq" class="_4lmld31 _4lmld30 o71fut1mo o71fut1n6 o71fut1ng" aria-labelledby="pricing-faq-headline"><div class="_4lmld33 _4lmld32 o71fut8 o71fut28 o71fut25 o71futbs"><h2 class="_4lmld35 _1gg5qfz2 _4lmld34 o71fut2h1" id="pricing-faq-headline">Frequent questions about API pricing</h2><div class="_4lmld36 o71fut2ew"><div data-orientation="vertical" class="_19vp9610"><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-panel-open="" aria-disabled="false" aria-controls="base-ui-_R_q2npfd5sqdbH1_" aria-expanded="true" id="base-ui-_R_q2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">What counts as a billable call?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" id="base-ui-_R_q2npfd5sqdbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_q2npfd5sqdbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto;animation-name:none" class="_10xzv4l0"><div class="_10xzv4l1 _10xzv4l3">One request to an endpoint is one billable call, whatever it returns. A Web Search call returning 1 result and one returning 100 cost the same. Contents is billed per page returned.</div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_1a2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">Do I need a credit card to start?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_1q2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">Do credits expire?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_2a2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">What happens if I run out of credits mid-run?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_2q2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">Are there rate limits?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_3a2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">How do the Research effort tiers differ, and which should I use?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_3q2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">Is the MCP server billed separately?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_4a2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">Do you offer volume or annual discounts?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_4q2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost" class="dcmxss0 dcmxss2 _1fqvkva7 _1fqvkva9 _1fqvkvad _1fqvkvaf _1rcd22i9 _1fqvkvak _1fqvkvaq">Can I get a DPA? Is there zero data retention?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mp2zas0"><span class="mp2zas1"></span><span class="mp2zas1 mp2zas2"></span></span></button></h3></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="hhvzmg0 hhvzmg2"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="aff4180"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-value="billable-call" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_5a2npfd5sqdbH2_" data-size="sm" data-color="default" data-variant="ghost"